# EH Helper Function guidelines

The Scripts/EH Helper Functions folder contains all the helper function scripts. 
- All helper function scripts should be prefixed by EH_FN_. This will clearly identify batch scripts created by the Decade program.

Helper functions are used by other scripts an can be evaled in using the following methods:
- eval(getScriptText([script_name], null, true));
- aa.include([script_name])
- include([script_name])
